/p><p>You can also schedule cleaning sessions or control the robot using voice commands through Amazon Alexa or Google Assistant. So, once you've set it up, you can let it get on with cleaning while you focus on something else.</p><section x-data=\"window.newsletter({ isDeal: true })\" x-init=\"init()\" aria-label=\"Newsletter Sign-Up\">\n        <p>混搭优惠</p>\n        <div x-ref=\"smsNewsletter\" x-cloak=\"\" x-show=\"showPhone\" data-ga-impression=\"\" data-ga-category=\"sms\" data-ga-module=\"incontent_nl_signup\" data-ga-label=\"deals\">\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    <p>注册即表示您同意按照提供的号码接收来自 Mashable Deals 的定期自动 SMS 营销消息。 消息和数据速率可能适用。 每天最多 2 条消息。 回复 STOP 可选择退出，回复 HELP 寻求帮助。 同意不是购买的条件。 请参阅我们的隐私政策和使用条款。</p>\n                </div>\n    </section>\n<p>Find this robot vacuum deal at Amazon right now.</p><section data-ga-module=\"offer-group\" data-ga-element=\"offer-group\" data-commerce-block=\"\">\n            <p>Our best editor-vetted Prime Day deals right now</p>\n                            <p>Apple AirPods Pro 3 Noise Cancelling Heart Rate Wireless Earbuds — $179.00 (List Price $249.00)</p>\n                            <p>Sony WH-1000XM5 Wireless Noise Canceling Headphones — $198.00 (List Price $399.99)</p>\n                            <p>Ring Indoor Cam Plus 2K Wired Security Camera (2-Pack, White) — $59.98 (List Price $119.98)</p>\n                            <p>Apple iPad 11\" 128GB Wi-Fi Retina Tablet (Blue, 2025 Release) — $399.00 (List Price $449.00)</p>\n                            <p>Ring 2nd Gen 2K Wired Video Doorbell With Chime (2026 Release) — $49.99 (List Price $114.98)</p>\n                            <p>Amazon Fire TV Stick 4K Plus Streaming Player With Remote (2025 Model) — $37.99 (List Price $69.99)</p>\n                            <p>Apple Watch Series 12 (GPS, 42mm, S/M Black Sport Band) — $349.99 (List Price $399.00)</p>\n                            <p>Blink Outdoor 